---
import LegalPage from '@/components/LegalPage.astro';
---
<LegalPage title="Cookie policy" description="Which cookies The Pilates Programme website uses, what they do, and how to change your choices at any time." path="/cookies" crumb="Cookies" updated="1 October 2026">
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>Nothing non-essential runs until you choose. <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-open-cookie-banner>Change my cookie choices</button></p>
  <h2>Essential</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>tpp-consent</strong> (browser storage): remembers your cookie choices for 12 months.</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>: protects forms from spam. Set only when a form loads.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Analytics (optional)</h2>
  <p>Google Analytics 4 via Google Tag Manager measures how the site is used, for example which pages lead to bookings. Cookies: _ga, _ga_*. Up to 2 years.</p>
  <h2>Marketing (optional)</h2>
  <p>Meta Pixel measures whether our advertising leads to course enquiries. Cookies: _fbp, _fbc. Up to 90 days.</p>
  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>Booking happens on Arketa, which sets its own cookies. Embedded content from other sites may set cookies under their policies.</p>
</LegalPage>
